("$1,000 of Bitcoin bought the day the Crypto.com Matt Damon ad aired would be worth $331 a year later.","you'd have $331","Ambiguous date: the Matt Damon spot launched in Oct 2021 (bitcoin about $61K, about $19-20K a year later, about $320), which fits $331; the script ties it to Super Bowl 2022, when bitcoin was about $42K and a year later about $22K (about $520). MISLEADING by analyst recall.",[]),
